+ owner DeclId
+ type-syntax SyntaxId

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ RuleDecl is DeclNode

` A rule of a class, which its constructors run once their bodies have: `when`, `whenever` on
` a value, a dependency `. m < p`, or a section that subscribes to a stream, `on s`.

+ owner DeclId

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ StyleDomainsDecl is DeclNode

` A line of a style class naming the domains a change to one of its properties raises, on the
` node itself or on its parent: `. ink -> paint`, `. flex -> layout on parent`.

+ owner DeclId

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ StyleRuleDecl is DeclNode

` A style rule a class writes, `• name:arg T`, which markup applies by naming it or by matching
` it to the type or id of what it makes; or one written in the body of another, or of one of
` its `when`s (`outer`), which is no member of the class: markup under an element the rule
` holding it is applied to applies it.

+ name Atom
+ owner DeclId
+ outer DeclId

